   Activated (i.e., set) landmines are buried beneath the ground.
Presumably rust monsters are not burrowing animals.

   The trap-munching behavior is a special case in "trap.c" --- the rust
monster is noticing that it's trapped and taking action to remedy the
situation. Once a monster is "trapped" by a landmine, the landmine ceases
to exist. :)

   So I definitely agree with your first diagnosis: Cool move. :)

